Note find every prime number up to 50 end note.
To check prime with n, do
  If n is less than 2, then
    give back no.
  end if.
  Set d to 2.
  While d times d is at most n,
    If n remainder of d is equal to 0, then
      give back no.
    end if.
    Change d by 1.
  end loop.
  give back yes.
end function.
Count from 2 to 50 using n,
  If the result of check prime with n, then
    Say n, text is prime. end text
  end if.
end loop.
